property done, flo
global glob

on startStep me
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setprop 66 .............................. done = 0
  [  3] getglobal 8 ............................. <glob>
  [  5] getchainedprop 9 ........................ <glob.managers>
  [  7] getchainedprop 10 ....................... <glob.managers.game>
  [  9] getchainedprop 11 ....................... <glob.managers.game.room>
  [ 11] getobjprop 79 ........................... <glob.managers.game.room.waiter>
  [ 13] setprop 78 .............................. flo = glob.managers.game.room.waiter
  [ 15] getprop 78 .............................. <flo>
  [ 17] pushsymb 92 ............................. <#dishes>
  [ 19] pusharglist 2 ........................... <flo, #dishes>
  [ 21] objcall 81 .............................. <flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes)>
  [ 23] not ..................................... <not flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes)>
  [ 24] jmpifz [ 31] ............................ if not flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes) then
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 29] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 31] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [ 35] extcall 44 .............................. return 1
  [ 37] ret
end

on checkDone me
  [  0] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [  2] jmpifz [  9] ............................ if done then
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  7] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [  9] getprop 78 .............................. <flo>
  [ 11] pushsymb 92 ............................. <#dishes>
  [ 13] pusharglist 2 ........................... <flo, #dishes>
  [ 15] objcall 81 .............................. <flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes)>
  [ 17] not ..................................... <not flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes)>
  [ 18] setprop 66 .............................. done = not flo.hasPayloadType(#dishes)
  [ 20] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [ 22] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <done>
  [ 24] extcall 44 .............................. return done
  [ 26] ret
end
